1.4981273408239701;\n  --border-width: 1px; --border-style: none; --border-color: rgba(from\nvar(--color-border) r g b / 1.0); --border-radius:\n0px; \n\n\">\n\n  </div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n    <header>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  <div \n  class=\" spacing-style text-block text-block--AU0U1T2x5aWhpaGVLO__blog-post-title h2\n    text-block--align-left\n  \"\n\n  style=\"\n    --padding-block-start: 0px; --padding-block-end:0px; \n--padding-inline-start:0px; --padding-inline-end:0px; \n\n    \n\n    --width: 100%;\n    --max-width: var(--max-width--body-normal);\n    \n      --text-align: left;\n    \n    \n  \"\n\n  \n>\n    <h1>Care for Him, the Ingenious Way: Supporting the Men You Love with Collagen </h1>\n  </div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n    </header><div id=\"shopify-block-ATi9ob3VrbUREb1ZlN__blog-post-content\" class=\"shopify-block\">\n\n<div class=\"blog-post-content rte\">\n  <rte-formatter>\n    <p>When it comes to wellness, we all want the people we care about to feel their best. Whether it’s your partner, friend, or family member, helping them stay healthy, active, and confident is key. But wellness products are often marketed with women in mind. It’s time to change that. Men deserve to feel great, too. Collagen is a perfect example, while often seen as a beauty supplement, its benefits go far beyond that. By introducing him to Ingenious Collagen+, you’re helping him enhance his health from the inside out.</p>\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Why Collagen Matters for Men</h2>\n<p>Collagen is the most abundant protein in the body and is crucial for the health of our skin, muscles, bones, joints, and connective tissues. While it’s often marketed as a beauty supplement, collagen plays a significant role in supporting overall wellness. As men age, natural collagen production decreases, which can lead to joint pain, slower muscle recovery, and a decrease in skin elasticity. By incorporating a high-quality collagen supplement like Ingenious into his routine, you’re helping him maintain his overall well-being, not just his appearance.</p>\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">The Gift of Wellness: Helping Him Feel His Best</h2>\n<p>Introducing Collagen+ to his daily routine is about more than just improving his appearance, it’s about supporting his health. Collagen contributes to gut and heart health, muscle strength, joint mobility, and even skin health. By providing him with a top-quality supplement like Ingenious, you’re offering a gift that enhances his vitality at every stage of life.</p>\n<style>.elementor-145043 .elementor-element.elementor-element-4a89519a{--display:flex;--flex-direction:row;--container-widget-width:initial;--container-widget-height:100%;--container-widget-flex-grow:1;--container-widget-align-self:stretch;--flex-wrap-mobile:wrap;--gap:0px 0px;--row-gap:0px;--column-gap:0px;--padding-top:0px;--padding-bottom:0px;--padding-left:0px;--padding-right:0px;}.elementor-145043 .elementor-element.elementor-element-7bdc6be1{--display:flex;--flex-direction:row;--container-widget-width:calc( ( 1 - var( --container-widget-flex-grow ) ) * 100% );--container-widget-height:100%;--container-widget-flex-grow:1;--container-widget-align-self:stretch;--flex-wrap-mobile:wrap;--align-items:center;--gap:0px 0px;--row-gap:0px;--column-gap:0px;}.elementor-145043 .elementor-element.elementor-element-7bdc6be1:not(.elementor-motion-effects-element-type-background), .elementor-145043 .elementor-element.elementor-element-7bdc6be1 > .elementor-motion-effects-container > .elementor-motion-effects-layer{background-color:var( --e-global-color-555d31e );}.elementor-145043 .elementor-element.elementor-element-7bdc6be1.e-con{--flex-grow:0;--flex-shrink:0;}.elementor-145043 .elementor-element.elementor-element-60d2c347{text-align:left;}.elementor-145043 .elementor-element.elementor-element-60d2c347 img{max-width:100%;}.elementor-145043 .elementor-element.elementor-element-21f21c87{--display:flex;--flex-direction:column;--container-widget-width:100%;--container-widget-h