 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"212aa217\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1d33c9e8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"1d33c9e8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<div class=\"elementor-button-wrapper\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Collagen for Gut Health: A Foundation for Overall Wellness</h2>\n<p>Gut health plays a bigger role in overall well-being than many realise. Collagen contains amino acids that help strengthen the intestinal lining, crucial for healthy digestion and nutrient absorption. For men, a healthy gut also supports energy levels, immune function, and heart health. Ingenious protective capsule ensures that collagen reaches the small intestine intact, where it can be most effective. This maximises its potential to support gut health and, ultimately, overall wellness.</p>\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Collagen and Heart Health: A Critical Connection</h2>\n<p>A healthy heart is essential for a healthy life. Collagen strengthens blood vessels and improves circulation, key factors in cardiovascular health. Studies suggest that collagen helps improve blood vessel elasticity, potentially reducing the risk of heart disease. While diet and exercise are often prioritised for heart health, collagen is a powerful ally in maintaining a strong and resilient heart.</p>\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Muscle Growth and Recovery: The Power of Collagen</h2>\n<p>Collagen is rich in amino acids that are essential for muscle repair and growth. Men who engage in physical activity, especially resistance training, can benefit from collagen supplementation to help speed up recovery, support muscle health, and boost strength. Whether he’s lifting weights, running, or staying active, collagen ensures his muscles stay strong and recover faster, preparing him for whatever comes next.</p>\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Joint Health: Staying Active and Pain-Free</h2>\n<p>Joint pain can affect many men, especially as they age or maintain an active lifestyle. Collagen is a key component of cartilage, the protective cushion between bones. Supplementing with collagen can improve joint mobility, reduce inflammation, and ease discomfort. Whether he’s working out or simply staying active, Collagen+ helps ensure his joints stay healthy and pain-free.</p>\n<style>.elementor-145034 .elementor-element.elementor-element-3c2b3cf3{--display:flex;--flex-direction:row;--container-widget-width:initial;--container-widget-height:100%;--container-widget-flex-grow:1;--container-widget-align-self:stretch;--flex-wrap-mobile:wrap;--gap:0px 0px;--row-gap:0px;--column-gap:0px;--padding-top:0px;--padding-bottom:0px;--padding-left:0px;--padding-right:0px;}.elementor-145034 .elementor-element.elementor-element-418315b3{--display:flex;--flex-direction:row;--container-widget-width:calc( ( 1 - var( --container-widget-flex-grow ) ) * 100% );--container-widget-height:100%;--container-widget-flex-grow:1;--container-widget-align-self:stretch;--flex-wrap-mobile:wrap;--align-items:center;--gap:0px 0px;--row-gap:0px;--column-gap:0px;}.elementor-145034 .elementor-element.elementor-element-418315b3:not(.elementor-motion-effects-element-type-background), .elementor-145034 .elementor-element.elementor-element-418315b3 > .elementor-motion-effects-container > .elementor-motion-effects-layer{background-color:var( --e-global-color-555d31e );}.elementor-145034 .elementor-element.elementor-element-418315b3.e-con{--flex-grow:0;--flex-shrink:0;}.elementor-145034 .elementor-element.elementor-element-3dd94e32{text-align:left;}.elementor-145034 .elementor-element.elementor-element-3dd94e32 img{max-width:100%;}.elementor-145034 .elementor-element.elementor-element-24114590{--dis